### Confirmation

| Version | Correcte | Moyenne | Mesures brutes (s) |
|---|---|---:|---|
| `baseline-e1` | True | 2.077697831392288 | `[2.0675207413733006, 2.067502981983125, 2.0177928935736418, 2.1677561616525054, 2.067916378378868]` |
